# Purpose
Helps users check format, file name, version, and content before sharing files.

# Key Sections
- Before sharing a file.
- Choose the right format.
- Use a clear file name.
- Check the version.
- Review the content.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Remind users to check sensitive information and permissions before sharing.

